# Author: Muhammad Mohsin Khan
# Created: 01.11.2026
# ==========================================================
# CalculiX GraphiX (cgx) FBD script
# Longeron (Three rod in series)
# Unit system: mm, s, N, tonne
#
# Fixed end: x = 0 mm. Free/load end: x = 787.4 mm.
# Reference end force for the CCX input deck: 44482.22 N.
#
# Mesh: Two-node 3D truss element (T3D2).
#
# Run from a writable working directory:
#   cgx -b longeron_rod.fbd
#
# The script exports the mesh and named node sets. Depending on the CGX
# version, the Abaqus-format mesh/set files are written using the set names.
# ==========================================================

# 1. CREATE GEOMETRY POINTS
pnt P0 0.0   0.0 0.0
pnt P1 254.0 0.0 0.0
pnt P2 431.8 0.0 0.0
pnt P3 787.4 0.0 0.0

# 2. CREATE THREE LINES
# Last parameter = number of divisions
line L1 P0 P1 1
line L2 P1 P2 1
line L3 P2 P3 1

# 3. ASSIGN ELEMENT TYPE
# BE2 is the CGX two-node line mesh type
elty all be2

# 4. GENERATE MESH
mesh all

# 5. DISPLAY MESH
plot e all
frame

# 6. EXPORT MESH TO ABAQUS FORMAT
send all abq
